# Gitignored: runtime copies of the committed templates. gc register and
# gc rig add mutate these files; keeping them out of git avoids dirty
# trees and merge conflicts on curriculum pulls.
# See workshop:#602 (register mutates city.toml) and the workshop
# comment on gastownhall/gascity#600 for upstream context.
pack.toml
city.toml
.gc/

# Beads / Dolt files (added by bd init)
.dolt/
*.db
.beads-credential-key

# Artifacts created when bd init / gc register run inside the city
# directory — these are agent-instruction copies, Claude Code hooks,
# and runtime traces that have no role in the committed curriculum.
.claude/
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
control-dispatcher-trace.log
packs.lock
